WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A whitewashed wall with an arched window onto a blue sky

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A small sun appears low in the window

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The sun climbs slowly across the sky

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The sun reaches the top of the window and the scene fades out
